        "type": "writing",
        "title": "It is important for everyone, including young people, to save money for their future. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tbn3dmtnDoJIrix556plLAVNgwe\"><em><strong>It is important for everyone, including young people, to save money for their future. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Saving Money Importance <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CBDXdlBsuo5cSdxkrqllRukYgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Saving Money Importance&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong>&nbsp;Việc tiết kiệm tiền rất quan trọng, đặc biệt với giới trẻ</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPsddbKgzoyp6AxMRJmlL8BagBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Saving Money Importance&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Buj7dJGGloJK8QxhO5IlDBHAgDg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bu0Pd9IWro7z2NxJcoFl10pygRf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nm5SdTr68ofHx9xGxANlq6dWgTe\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </a></strong></span>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RkZldWu8XostFuxwmoTlgMRtg2g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>set money aside <em>(tiết kiệm tiền)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UbS4dLvQ4ojYeAxqdYrlreEhg4g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>develop habits <em>(h&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh th&oacute;i quen)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cu63dzyLVoidvXxT8XvltsRHgeb\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>tiết kiệm tiền c&oacute; lợi cho người trẻ về mặt l&acirc;u d&agrave;i.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCIYdvOXqop5QbxoryVlZon6gZd\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BKqAduxGvoG1ZixugNqlUvfkgUc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TSiadjFI9oCp1JxX9kallCxmgG2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số l&yacute; do cho việc giới trẻ chưa cần tiết kiệm ngay.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KsChdDwscofqMVxi1duljnbXglf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng tiết kiệm từ sớm sẽ c&oacute; lợi đ&aacute;ng kể cho người trẻ l&acirc;u d&agrave;i.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4w0dbuEqoTrvaxi2yQlDUTGg3e\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXgudBcaso0M7Fx8vImlp7sygre\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZcYddwS4Vos18xxrxR7ltHk2gmb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BBiGdpHhRoY07ox19VWlujEhgAh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QigjdXHmdo2yi8x4txilmdXkgUe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong><strong>B&agrave;n về một số l&yacute; do cho việc giới trẻ chưa cần tiết kiệm ngay</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, giới trẻ gặp phải nhiều vấn đề khiến cho việc tiết kiệm kh&oacute; khăn.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JHyyd6Hjnoa7IuxOBnglWxG5gFh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Thanh thiếu ni&ecirc;n cần phải đầu tư v&agrave;o <em>ph&aacute;t triển bản th&acirc;n</em> <em>(self-development)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RijXdDmd9oO2A2xZUamlXpgcgTg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Example</strong><strong>: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, học th&ecirc;m hoặc <em>lấy chứng chỉ (obtaining professional certifications)</em> sẽ cần nhiều tiền, gi&uacute;p cho người trẻ <em>ph&aacute;t triển sự nghiệp tốt hơn</em> <em>(enhance career prospects)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ONsfd0HOaodde8xHjtGlFGuCgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Nhiều người trẻ vẫn nhận được <em>sự hỗ trợ t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh</em> <em>(financial support)</em> như tiền ăn ở từ bố mẹ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MsVedOdRjol7SExcrHBlfKvOgTg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact</strong><strong>: </strong>C&oacute; thể tập trung cho tương lai tốt hơn, gi&uacute;p giảm bớt g&aacute;nh nặng t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh l&ecirc;n bản th&acirc;n <em>(personal financial burden)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng tiết kiệm từ sớm sẽ c&oacute; lợi cho người trẻ l&acirc;u d&agrave;i</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng tiết kiệm sẽ c&oacute; lợi đ&aacute;ng kể cho người trẻ.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xx4RdRzyToO5CuxP3sDllXCogJb\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core Idea: </strong>C&oacute; khoản tiền d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho <em>trường hợp khẩn cấp</em> <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">(emergency funds)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">.</span></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DBwndqktaojSzuxJtxil1RnhgzA\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact</strong><strong>: </strong>Gi&uacute;p người trẻ xử l&yacute; được t&igrave;nh huống khẩn cấp như thất nghiệp, tr&aacute;nh được việc <em>đổ nợ</em> <em>(falling into debt)</em> hoặc <em>phụ thuộc qu&aacute; mức</em> <em>(overly dependent) </em>v&agrave;o người kh&aacute;c.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ONsfd0HOaodde8xHjtGlFGuCgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Giảm stress v&agrave; cải thiện sức khỏe tinh thần.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MsVedOdRjol7SExcrHBlfKvOgTg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact</strong><strong>: </strong>C&oacute; thể <em>đưa ra quyết định cho bản th&acirc;n (autonomous decisions)</em> m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng phụ thuộc v&agrave;o bố mẹ. Gi&uacute;p cải thiện mối quan hệ gia đ&igrave;nh v&agrave; người trẻ <em>tự tin hơn v&agrave;o bản th&acirc;n</em> <em>(self-confidence)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VfQ3d5yCDoJva6xFyAmlDvTug7D\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INg5dQKSWoNIgxx5GMWli5wMg8h\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>prioritize doing sth <em>(ưu ti&ecirc;n l&agrave;m việc g&igrave; đ&oacute;)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INg5dQKSWoNIgxx5GMWli5wMg8h\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">early saving habits <em>(th&oacute;i quen tiết kiệm từ sớm)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 728,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YZ9ed7L5Xoe2RCxBiXrlItTHgrd\">Opinions are divided on whether it is important for young people to set aside money for their future. Although there are valid reasons why youth may prioritize spending over saving at present, I believe that developing saving habits early is crucial for long-term financial well-being.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14105,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 729,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NEvGd4oe7oJwYOxA4TilwCLegDd\">Admittedly, young people may face several pressures that may make immediate saving challenging. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">The primary consideration is their need to invest in self-development. For example, taking additional courses or obtaining professional certifications requires significant financial resources, which could enhance career prospects and lead to better income in the future. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, many young people still receive financial support from their parents, who often cover basic expenses like food and accommodation, making saving seem less urgent. Therefore, the young could focus better on their education and future plans, helping them reduce personal financial pressure.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14105,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 730,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJ1xdx4GjoXbnDxn9Dll4yQBgog\">However, I am convinced that starting to save early brings substantial benefits. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">Most importantly, having emergency funds is crucial as life can be unpredictable, especially for young people. Unexpected situations like medical emergencies or temporary unemployment can arise at any time, thus having savings helps avoid falling into debt or becoming overly dependent on others during such crises.<span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, being financially independent can significantly reduce stress and improve mental well-being. This is because when young people can make autonomous decisions about their education or career without constantly relying on family support, it fosters better relationships with parents and builds self-confidence.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14105,
